  charged particles ( AUG. 2023)                                  1925 1451
                                                                  1925 1451
  H.I. Kim (KAERI),                                               1925 1451
  H.Y. Lee, T. Kawano, S.A. Kuvin, and M.W. Herman (LANL)         1925 1451
                                                                  1925 1451
  Energy-angular distributions of discrete and continuum levels   1925 1451
  and photon transitions related to emitted charged particles     1925 1451
  (proton, deuteron, triton, helium-3 and alpha)                  1925 1451
  have been updated [1] using CoH3 [2] and formatted into         1925 1451
  the ENDF-6 format using DeCE [3]. The Q-values have been        1925 1451
  calculated using the mass data in Audi's 2012 mass table [4]    1925 1451
  and FRDM2012 massess [5].                                       1925 1451
                                                                  1925 1451
  Summary of updated MF/MT                                        1925 1451
  MF=15  MT= 103, 107 were deleted.                               1925 1451
  MF=12/14  MT= 601-609, 801-809 were deleted.                    1925 1451
  MF=3  MT= 600-609, 649, 800-809, 849 were added.                1925 1451
  MF=6  MT= 600-609, 649, 800-809, 849 were added.                1925 1451
